OL,3,GNEWSAWoman saved by CPR has "another
OL,4,Achance at life"
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman at a concert who survived a
OL,7,Fcardiac arrest thanks to the fast
OL,8,Factions of event staff has encouraged
OL,9,Fmore people to learn CPR.
OL,11,FIt comes as South Western Ambulance
OL,12,FService is holding a series of tuition
OL,13,Fevents across the region, teaching
OL,14,Fbasic resuscitation techniques.
OL,16,FA trainer said there were around 14,000
OL,17,Fdefibrillators in the region and the
OL,18,Fservice wanted more people to have
OL,19,Fconfidence using them.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
