OL,3,GNEWSAWoman saved by CPR has "another
OL,4,Achance at life"
OL,5,
OL,6,FEsther Baker, who survived her cardiac
OL,7,Farrest, said "the reality is if you do
OL,8,Fnothing they will die" and the quick
OL,9,Fintervention of others had given her
OL,10,F"another chance at life".
